<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EPH" style="id">- HUNGWARHEA</book>
  <para style="toc1">EPH</para>
  <para style="toc2">EPH</para>
  <para style="toc3">EPH</para>
  <para style="mt">EPH</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EPH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 1:1" />Bulus bucuma bu Kristi Yesu una u iyaje na Hwinsu, kurwa pa aco na ia̱gu i burya̠ na yiwa na Apisa, ana yaje na Kristi Yesu: <verse eid="EPH 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 1:2" />I burya̠ na dala burya̠ pa Buca a buci na Bugwama bu doone Yesu Kristi ai laga.<verse eid="EPH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Itano uno uburya̠ pa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 1:3" />Izangacu isa i Hwinsu na Buca abuci Yesu Kristi, ina ci tane uno u burya̠ cikarigo ci Bware na zaro na tonba nu burya̠ una u yiwa na Kristi. <verse eid="EPH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 1:4" />Kafi i ia̱gu i doone Hwinsu uci tanga ci sa aco uba gaci buna ci yiwa na suwa u Yesu Kristi, zwama ci san aco nagu magwata̱ hinda aco na za eewo zwama maka̠la̠ ma Bware <verse eid="EPH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 1:5" />Hwinsu una u ci tanga tun na jigo ci san nga saawo suba pa Yesu Kristi, na itangano ina isa uika̱ na ina Bware buba ia̱ <verse eid="EPH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 1:6" />U i haruni zwam izangacu na i burya̱ i uba, ina uba pan gaci buna ci yiwa tare na bwa buna uba ka̱ri. <verse eid="EPH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 1:7" />Pa Yesu ga̱ci hin icagago pa mahya ma Bware, na icagagu i magwata̱, zwama moso i burya̠ a Hwinsu <verse eid="EPH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 1:8" />nga buba ci hacigage na mahansa na ci daka̱ ci tibe. <verse eid="EPH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 1:9" />Hwinsu uba yaje ci daki ciswin ci uba nga uba ginbage na i burya̠ na laco pa Kristi, <verse eid="EPH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 1:10" />ina uba ginbo bini si hon u i uba tanaga tibe ina i yiwa na cinge na zaro i yana pa buco buika̱, Kristi. <verse eid="EPH 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 1:11" />Pa Yesu Hwinsu uba ci tanga, cisan aco na ai ia̱go gajo nga uba ia̱ shiri buna ia̱gi tibai nga uba ginbago, <verse eid="EPH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 1:12" />Hwinsu u ia̱ haruni zwama gaci buna ci rwage itana soo pa Kristi, ci i dala ai zangacu i uba. <verse eid="EPH 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 1:13" />Ga̱hi buna aba tane pa Kristi nga ga̱hi i hoge cikarigo ci laco ci kamahinda, cina cisa ci icagago. Hwinsu ui tane tanbari, na a̱huru a burya̠ ana uba hin an ui pan, <verse eid="EPH 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 1:14" />A̱huru a burya̠ Hwinsu abe asa kamahinda an cisan aco na ai gajo ina Hwinsu uba ia̱gi saawo suba alkawali an ui pan ga zwama na izangaco iziya uba<verse eid="EPH 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ahunda na godjiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 1:15" />Zwama haruni, tun hon una u gya na hoge i iyadwo nibui pa Buca̠ bu yaba Yesu na maka̠la̠ amabui pa aco cihano ci burya̠, <verse eid="EPH 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 1:16" />Na curiwo i goju i Hwinsu zwama ga̱hi. Na ma'inganuwa na ga̱hi hun gya na yiwa na ahunda. <verse eid="EPH 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 1:17" />Ni kabo Hwinsu u Buca̠ bu yaba Yesu Kristi, ui pan a̱huru a mahansa ana ai hyanagu, zwama go daki Hwinsu na burya̠. <verse eid="EPH 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 1:18" />Na yiwa na ahunda hinda Hwinsu uba u gonje haisa hasuwa ahahin zwama i daki ina isa i tano soo ina aba ai i'uga, gajo una uza uhare pa korwa aco na yiwa na ia̱go i burya̠, <verse eid="EPH 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 1:19" />na koce u Hwinsu una uza uhare pa korwa pa aco na yadje nuba. Koce uni usa nga̱ ibwana i danrun u koce Hwinsu, <verse eid="EPH 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 1:20" />koce una uba hoge ube ansige Kristi pa aco akwajo kwa na dala bware na wa u cuga u Hwinsu na zaro, <verse eid="EPH 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 1:21" />Kristi ibe iyiwa na cugwama ci tibai ina yiwa na zata, cina aba ai pan, cina ci zake ka̱mu cigwama cina ciyiwa na doone una u yiwa na korwa. <verse eid="EPH 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 1:22" />Hinda Hwinsu iri tibai i yan na imya na buna u bware kwa na san bu labe na ka̱mu ina yiwa na coci, <verse eid="EPH 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 1:23" />coci ube usa ikanga i Kristi, buna bu isinju i ka̱mu tibai na tibai tuhonba.<verse eid="EPH 1:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EPH 2" />
  <para style="s1">Ihinwo a̱hurun na suwa u Kristi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 2:1" />Ga̠hi na jigu, ikwadago na nagu u i burya̠ na magwata̱, <verse eid="EPH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 2:2" />nga ga̱hi i yanse ne lagana yina a doone na mugwamgwam mu aco mupyala mu zaro, muna a a̱huru a muba a yiwa na amagan soo wa aco na wondje lagana cikarigo ci Hwinsu. <verse eid="EPH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 2:3" />Ka̱mu nuci ci yanse tare nab na jigu, na hogo laco u dala naci a magwata̱ hinda na lagana ina hasoo a haci hab ginbo ga̱ci ci ia̱. Ci san aco na Hwinsu ui ci pan wahala. <verse eid="EPH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 2:4" />Ama zwama maka̠la̠ ma Hwinsu apacu, Hwinsu u ci cibe yama dinyiya, <verse eid="EPH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 2:5" />u ci wasinge tare na Kristi tun hun una ga̱ci ci ma wunbasi na magwata̱, zwama i burya̠ i Hwinsu aba ci cagage. <verse eid="EPH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 2:6" />Hinda Hwinsu u ci ansenge na Yesu u ci dale zata u zaro na ia̱go cigwama na bware, <verse eid="EPH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 2:7" />Hwinsu u i haruni zwama bu cibai aco kurwa u zamani nga̱ musuwa mu i burya̠ waba na koce woba ni suwa maka̱la̱ moba unu u ci cibe na suwa u Kristi Yesu. <verse eid="EPH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 2:8" />Zwama maka̱la̱ ma Hwinsu uba ci cagage, icagago nuhi isa daje pa Hwinsu. <verse eid="EPH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 2:9" />sa ibwana ni hin, zwama tiganba buta ma supa bisina. <verse eid="EPH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 2:10" />zwama ka̱mu nuci cisa ibwana i wa u Hwinsu,aci gope na ci ia̱ga na Kristi Yesu zwama ci ia̱ ibwana i burya̠, ina Hwinsu uba ia̱gi tun haya hana ha ali.<verse eid="EPH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kristi ici ganmi ka̱mu nuci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 2:11" />Zwama haruni, dakaje ga̱hi yasa hayahudawa na maco hal na oga &lt;&lt;aco na za kaciya&gt;&gt; Aco na yiwa na ma'oga &lt;&lt;Aco na za kaciya&gt;&gt; (ina sa ibwana wa i woma)- <verse eid="EPH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 2:12" />dakaje hun uni ima handgage na Kristi, izanuwa ihuga i dala na Isra'ila nga̱ hanyagata pa kucuna ku alkawali, nagu u cidaka̱ na nagu u Hwinsu na doone. <verse eid="EPH 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 2:13" />Ama baniya na Yesu ga̱hi buna i yanse cimere Hwinsu ui kuluwa ciyabu zwama mahya ma Kristi. <verse eid="EPH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 2:14" />Zwama Yesu na icwa iba isa ilabutuwa i suwa nuci, ina san hayahudawa ha san i bikan, hinda bu huzi ubwaga una cibagi nagu u maka̱la̱ ma sicwa saba, <verse eid="EPH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 2:15" />Bu zacige icibago i Musa na giri u cikarigo pa ijigu i mahya ma bware. Bu ia̱ haruni zwam a silacome na azwaga amenwa pa sizwaga sirya sini, na haruni an hyangiyo aco dala a burya̠, <verse eid="EPH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 2:16" />bu i haruni zwam a shiri aco na Hwinsu pa u'o una Yesu iba kwadji zata u'on u masacu, bu hone nagu maka̱la̱ ma sicwa saba. <verse eid="EPH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 2:17" />Bu kurya bui zwamga cikarigo ci Hwinsu aco na aisa Hayahudwa na aco na sa hayahudawa aba na ayiwa ciyabu. <verse eid="EPH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 2:18" />Pa Yesu ka̱mu nuci ci hyan dama u ga̱ci ci kore pa Buca a buci na a̱huru a burya̠ a Hwinsu. <verse eid="EPH 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 2:19" />Zwama haruni ga̱hi buna isa hayahudawa isa hanyagata baniya isa aco yaba tare na aco Hwinsu, <verse eid="EPH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 2:20" />ai ganmi i nyaga nga ima ina saawo sina silmajiri si Kristi Yesu na Acubago, na icwa ibe tare una usa ipicu ima. <verse eid="EPH 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 2:21" />Bube ka̱mu busa ima ina i ganmi ima hal i monse isa iginga ilabe ina aba ia̱gi Hwinsu. <verse eid="EPH 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 2:22" />Ga̱hin ma na suwa u Kristi aba ai ma tare zwama i sanya yaba ina a̱huru a Hwinsu uba ui madala.<verse eid="EPH 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EPH 3" />
  <para style="s">Bulus ia̱gi aco na aisa Hayahudawa cikarigo ci Hwisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 3:1" />Zwama haruni Gya, Bulus, buna aba tane na ukaba u ci'incu zwama Kristi Yesu hinda zwama ga̱hin buna aisa Hayahudawa-<verse eid="EPH 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 3:2" />Na daki i hogo na i burya̠ na ibwana ina Hwinsu uba na cibe zwama ga̱hi, <verse eid="EPH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 3:3" />an, pa halabuwa Hwinsu uba na cibe, nga̱ gya na zwamano cimu. <verse eid="EPH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 3:4" />Si i karanci ina gya rubuce, hinda, i daki asiri a suwa nimui ana a yiwa pa ilagano i Kristi, <verse eid="EPH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 3:5" />una aba ai cibewa aco na a aliyi nga̱ aba cibe aco na yiwa ne lagano Hwinsu na acuma. <verse eid="EPH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 3:6" />Ciswin a cini zwama cikarigo ci burya̠ aco na ai sa Hayahudawa san aco gadwo tare Israila, ga̱ci naba cisa ikanga ikan, hinda ciza habe u alkawali a Hwinsu uba ci ia̱gi pa Kristi Yesu. <verse eid="EPH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 3:7" />An maisi buna bu yiwa na pan cikarigo ci burya̠ ina aba na pan pa koce u Hwinsu koce na yiwa na suwa numui. <verse eid="EPH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 3:8" />Ko nga̱ gya nisa bu noya pa aco Hwinsu, Hwinsu una pan i burya̠ zwama gya ia̱gi aco na ai sa Hayahudawa cikarigo ci laco dinyiya ci kristi, <verse eid="EPH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 3:9" />hinda gya zwama aco ka̱mu nga Hwinsu uba yiwa cibaga i ciswin ci uba, una u ia̱gi tebai na tebai tun na jigu. <verse eid="EPH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 3:10" />Ina uba yiwa na genbo baniya, pa coci, ciswin ci mahansa ma Hwinsu a dakacumi mugwamgwam na aco yiwa pa mudaluwo mu cigwama, <verse eid="EPH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 3:11" />ini ina Hwinsu uba i zwama u sinji ina iyiwa tun na jigu na suwa uba pa Kristi Yesu Buca̠ bu yaba nuci. <verse eid="EPH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 3:12" />Na suwa Yesu na itano i soo pa Yesu ci hin koce kurwa pa bware sa tare na iwasa. <verse eid="EPH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 3:13" />Zwam haruni, na kabo, hasoo hata dulo zwama iri u sungorwo una u gya na hoge zwama ga̱hi, una ui sanana i cikibi a cihin.<verse eid="EPH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ahunda a Bulus zwama aco a Apisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 3:14" />Zwama haruni ube usan gya ni yiwa na kuzaci pa buca abuci bu zaro, <verse eid="EPH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 3:15" />zwama pa buba tanba azwaga na zaro na doone aba hin iziya ya ba. <verse eid="EPH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 3:16" />Ni yiwa na ia̱ga ahunda pa Hwinsu u zaro na koce uba ui jidane koce na a̱huru a burya̠ na hasuwa ahahin, <verse eid="EPH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 3:17" />nga̱ Kristi iba i ese hasuwa ahahin zwama itano i hasoo. Ni yiwa na ahunda maka̠la̠ ma ese na hasoo ahahin, <verse eid="EPH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 3:18" />zwama i hin koce, na ga̱hi na alagano Hwinsu, zwama i daki hanri na zangaro na zata na zwamucu u maka̠la̠ ma Kristi, <verse eid="EPH 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 3:19" />zwama ga̱hin idaki an maka̠la̠ ma Kristi ma hwace cidak ci tibai zwama i hin cisinju ci Hwinsu. <verse eid="EPH 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 3:20" />Bane cizangacu ci Hwinsu nuci cina ci koce ciba ci yiwa na ia̱ga ibwana apaci hal ci zake ina ga̱ci kabo, ko ina ga̱ci ginbage na hasoo, <verse eid="EPH 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 3:21" />izangacu isa i Hwinsu na aco na yiwa pa Kristi Yesu hal korwa u hazamani din din din! Harbuni.<verse eid="EPH 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EPH 4" />
  <para style="s">Dala a maka̠la̠ na Yesu Kristi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 4:1" />Gya baniya bu yaba ci'incu bu Hwinsu na hin iri gaba na cihanu nga̱ ba ci ya i'ogo <verse eid="EPH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 4:2" />Ka̱mu na nagu laco na laco, na wahala doone, gya hin i maka̠la̠; <verse eid="EPH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 4:3" />Ia̱ga kokari ima dale tare nga̱ a̱huru a burya̠ aba pan na dala a burya̠. <verse eid="EPH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 4:4" />Hinda ikanga uika̱, ahuru uika̱, nga̱ aba i ogo zwama bware <verse eid="EPH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 4:5" />Hwinsu uika̱ iyadjo uika̱, u baptisma uika̱, <verse eid="EPH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 4:6" />Hwinsu uika̱ buca, buna buyiwa zata ka̱mu na ka̱mu.<verse eid="EPH 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 4:7" />Ama an pa taganba daje nga̱ Yesu izana i Kristi. <verse eid="EPH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 4:8" />Harbuni cikarigo ci Hwinsu ciba hin:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 4:8">&lt;&lt; Nga̱ bware buba yinda kurwo zaro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 4:8">bu zangi aco na aba palage</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 4:8">kwa bware na pana aco daje.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="EPH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 4:9" />(Biya &lt;&lt;aba hin isa i yindano&gt;&gt; ayiwa ni nufi ni jigo bware bu kanzigi kuruwaimiye ni cinge? <verse eid="EPH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 4:10" />Buna bo kanzige bube hinda bu yinda zaro zwama bu sinji ni zaro ni cinge ka̱mu. <verse eid="EPH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 4:11" />Hinda bware bube bu pan cagiya silmajiri si Yesu, acagiya acoma, cagiya i kulago cikarigo ci Hwinsu, acagiya Pastor, acagiya awalami, acagiya a i wa'azi cikarigo ci Hwinsu; <verse eid="EPH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 4:12" />Bu iyi haruni zwama a kimga aco pa ibwana i Ikilisiya, zwama alagano abe adaki Kristi ni burya̠: <verse eid="EPH 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 4:13" />Ni harbuni ga̱ci ci sani buika̱ pa i yaju ni idako i bwa bu Hwinsu hal cima hwi, nga̱ ga̱ci ci daki numa Hwinsu nga Kristi.<verse eid="EPH 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 4:14" />A i haruni zwama ta ci maringya nga̱ saawo, ko ci san nga saawo sina aba yiwa ni a̱ge ni siba, mupyala mu icibago ini yasa i burya̠ zangaco hankali waba aco maha̱sa hinda aba ni zangi hankali waba aba ni cutaga. <verse eid="EPH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 4:15" />Zwama harbuni cita zwamga cibya kwa di kamahinda ni maka̠la̠, ga̱ci musa ni cikarigo ci Hwinsu hal ga̱cu wuci ni hali u Kristi ana asi icwa i ikanga pa alagano. <verse eid="EPH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 4:16" />Zwama bware bube bu yiwa ni cigwama ci ikanga ka̱mu a magami a ma kumgage hinda ini a magami a i ibwana hal musa ni soo u maka̠la̠.<verse eid="EPH 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">A̱HURU PUN NA SUWA KRISTI</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 4:17" />Hinda, na yiwa na zwamgana, har ka baniya na yiwa na zwamgana na ziya Bube, ita iyi iri dala aco banza ana dakuwo ina ba na iye. <verse eid="EPH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 4:18" />Soo waba bu duri, aza a̱huru Hwinsu, zwama asa jahilce hoba, zoma tauri sicwa saba. <verse eid="EPH 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 4:19" />Zwama hasoo haba haza mu'inya, a inago a mero na cidana, hinda a za malaku ma ibwana i ciri. <verse eid="EPH 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 4:20" />Sa harbuni ga̱hi ce icibago Kristi! <verse eid="EPH 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 4:21" />A tabo ne zwamana noma bware, hinda nga̱ alagano bware, ai cibage pa bware nga̱ kamahinda Yesu aba yiwa. <verse eid="EPH 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 4:22" />I curi iri dala nahin a jigu, una ga̱hi yanse nuba da. una ui haciga zwam maka̱la̱ ma i doone, <verse eid="EPH 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 4:23" />Hasoo a hahin ha maringiya ha pun, <verse eid="EPH 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 4:24" />Ci mo zangi soo burya̠ una u nyaga na soo u Hwinsu pa kamahinda na nagu ciri. <verse eid="EPH 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 4:25" />Zwama harbuni curi ia̱ga cibe, hinda i zwame ina isa kamahinda pa buco magida mabo, zwama cisa hasala ha aco naci. <verse eid="EPH 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 4:26" />si bu hacige soo, ita ia̱ magwata̱, ita hacigaga soo hala kuro iso Hwinsu, <verse eid="EPH 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 4:27" />Hinda ta pana ublis yina isu (Watani Ijeba) <verse eid="EPH 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 4:28" />Hinda buhi buta ye kenan ihe, ama na haruni, bu ia̠ ibwana i burya̠ na koce u wa u buba, har bu hyan ina buba pana acho na za. <verse eid="EPH 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 4:29" />Hinda taci yada cikarigo ci banza ci sira na numi, kacina cisi ci burya̠ hon waba yiwa bukata, zwama pa alheri pa aco na hugage. <verse eid="EPH 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 4:30" />Hinda ta hicigaga soo a̱huru a Hwinsu, una uba tane kubta̱ zwama hon i cagago. <verse eid="EPH 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 4:31" />Hinda maryabi je na idabo i soo, ubobo u soo na pushi. Ibada̱ na cicon, aza i kumgago i soo ko i menwa̱. <verse eid="EPH 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 4:32" />Ia̱gya je sicwa a sihin i burya̠, i ma yape nga̱ Hwinsu uba ui yape zwama Yesu Kristi.<verse eid="EPH 4:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EPH 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 5:1" />I nya̱ga nga̱ Hwinsu, zama, isa saawo sani ba ka̠ri dinyiya <verse eid="EPH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 5:2" />I madaliya dala a maka̠la̠ , nga̱ Kristi iba ci ka̠ri hinda bu pa ico yaba zwam daje u kamshi pa Hwinsu. <verse eid="EPH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 5:3" />Zwam harbuniya na suwa nuhi ata banga zwamu cidana, ko ibwana i ciri, ico ikaru icwa, zwamu aco naza hali aniya aba aco Hwinsu. <verse eid="EPH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 5:4" />Harbuni hinda ata ibanga na cikarigo kawai na uno nuhin, na dala a cidana, zwamu wa gyamaciwa na ga̠hi. kwadai ipano u Hwinsu cilabe. <verse eid="EPH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 5:5" />Gahi ma idaki: buna bu egu cidana, nagu soo u burya̠ ko hinda buna bu kari icya buba-buni buco busa buna bu pagano uya cilabe - hinda buza i ise na yaba i Kristi na cigwama ci Hwinsu. <verse eid="EPH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 5:6" />Ita yada bucihya bui paculage na uno u laco; zwama shara'a si Hwinsu a yiwa na kurya ka̱mu pa aco na wunje lagana cikarigo ci Hwinsu. <verse eid="EPH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 5:7" />Zwamu harbuniya ita gama sicwa asihin naba. <verse eid="EPH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 5:8" />Zwamu gahi na jigu i yasa na ci'incu, amma baniya ga̱ci isa haske na suwa Bugwama bu doone. Imadaliya nga̱ aco haske. <verse eid="EPH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 5:9" />(Zwamu haske supa mubwana bu burya̠ na adalci na zwam kamahinda) <verse eid="EPH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 5:10" />Byanganaje i daki ina Bugwama bu duniya buba huge laco. <verse eid="EPH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 5:11" />Curiji ia̱gu ibwana ci'icu, kodi i pusi ibwana ci'icu. <verse eid="EPH 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 5:12" />Zwamu uza mu'inya̱ a rube ibwana ina aba ia̱gu na ci'icu. <verse eid="EPH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 5:13" />Kamu ina aba a kuliye na cingero i daki nga̱ aba nyaga, <verse eid="EPH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 5:14" />Zwama ina aba cibe isa cingero. ube u san aba hya: &lt;&lt;Masinge, pa aco na a kwadago, Kristi ibu pana cigero.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="EPH 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 5:15" />Zwama harbuniya, masikai je nga ga̱hi i madale- ita sana nga aco nagu u maha̱sa amma nga̱ aco maha̱sa, <verse eid="EPH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 5:16" />Ia̱je dama iyi i burya̠ na zarafi ana ga̱hi iza, zwamu hon ana gaci yiwa a sinji na maguta. <verse eid="EPH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 5:17" />Zwamu harbuni ita sana ushashasha kwadi idaki ina Bugwama bu doone buba bu ginbo. <verse eid="EPH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 5:18" />Ita siga na maro ma jiri, si ma bu hune mai bu kula pa nagu u hankali. na haruniya, masinji na ahuru a burya̠ . <verse eid="EPH 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 5:19" />I makargyaga cikariguwa ci burya̠ ci Hwinsu, hazuga ha pano u Hwinsu cilabe, ia̱ hazuga na suwa na buniya pa bugwama bu doone. <verse eid="EPH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 5:20" />Tamba hon gahin na pagana Hwinsu bu ce cilabe zwamu tigya ka̱mu, na ziya i Yesu Kristi Bugwama bu duniya. <verse eid="EPH 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 5:21" />I maka̠la̠ngi ka̱mu nga sicwa a sihin na wasa Kristi.<verse eid="EPH 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Si'ah na aco cware</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 5:22" />Si'a si cigya, cutanaje sucwa asihin pa sare asihi nga Buca̱ bu yaba. <verse eid="EPH 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 5:23" />Zwamu bware bube buza iko na Bu'a buba bubiya busa icwa Bu'a a buba, Inga Yesu Kristi abasa icwa yi coci, ikanga yiba, ibiya na aco i bware ibiya i caga ikanga. <verse eid="EPH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 5:24" />Baniya nga̱ alagano aba yaje a pa sucwa saba pa Yesu Kristi, harbuniya hinda si'a siba si pa sucwa sisib pa sare siba na tuwamba kamu. <verse eid="EPH 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 5:25" />Aco cware, ka̱la̱ngi Si'a sihi nga̱ Yesu kristi aba ka̠ri alagano abware hal bware bu pa ico i bware zwamu waba. <verse eid="EPH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 5:26" />Zwamu alagano aya ko na ciriye pa Hwinsu pa cikarigiwa ci uba hinda na guzagu weba na miya. <verse eid="EPH 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 5:27" />Bware bu iyi haruniya zwamu hon ana bware buba bui pana aco i burya̠ alagano aya na daraja dinya ko na daba, hinda ko na nagu magwata̱. <verse eid="EPH 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 5:28" />Harubuniya hinda, aco cware i ka̱la̱ngi si'a sihi nga mukanga amuhi buna bu kari bu'a buba to bu ka̠ri icwa i buba. <verse eid="EPH 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 5:29" />Aza buna bui wunje icwa ibuba kwa bu i kula na ikanga i buba. kyabo ni Yesu kristi aba kari kamu alagano waba. <verse eid="EPH 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 5:30" />Zamu harbuniya gaci cisa kama ikanga yaba. <verse eid="EPH 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 5:31" />Inga abba rubuci na cikarigiwa ci Musa &lt;&lt;Buco bu cure buca na mace buba buba mayabta̱ pa Bu'a buba aba barya̱ a sanya i bika̱. munegwa muika&gt;&gt; <verse eid="EPH 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 5:32" />Uniya usa asiri ana zwambuci- amma nawa na ye cikarigo ci Yesu Kristi na alagano aburya̠ . <verse eid="EPH 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EPH 5:33" />Kamu na harbuniya, taga kamu bui ka̱ri bu buba nga buba kari icwa ibuba, hinda Bu'a buba pa Bware buba cilabe.<verse eid="EPH 5:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EPH 6" />
  <para style="s">Sawo na Amaci a siba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 6:1" />Sawo, ia̱ji amace nahi biyaya zwama bugwama bu duniya, zwamu ubiya usa na burya̠ . <verse eid="EPH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 6:2" />&lt;&lt;Pana Buce na Maci nabo cilabe&gt;&gt; - ubiya usa doka a jigo na silkawari. <verse eid="EPH 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 6:3" />Zwamu gu bui madala na burya̠ hinda bui sana dinya na u doone una hinda bui huge laco. <verse eid="EPH 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 6:4" />Gahi Haca̱ca̱, ita sana sawo asihin si huge sungura na ga̱hi, kwadi, ga̱hi cibe ga yina u burya̠ i zwamaga alaga yina Bugwama bu doone. <verse eid="EPH 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 6:5" />Hinda Gyama, ga̱hi ma ilaga buco abuhi bu doone na pagana ga cilabe na wasa yaba, hinda na suwa uika, kyabo nga guwa bui lagan Kristi. <verse eid="EPH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 6:6" />Ita lagano i hyanu hisa, nga ana yiwa na gimbo a yabi pa hisa ha aco amma gahi isa gyama Yesu kristi, gahi na lagana ina Hwinsu uba gimbo in suwa nohin. <verse eid="EPH 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 6:7" />Eaje ibwana nahi na suwa uika, nga iyiwa na ia̱gana Bugwamma bu doone sa Bumma. <verse eid="EPH 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 6:8" />Zwamu idaki na Hwinsu cupa tagamba kamu na i burya̠ ina buba ia̱gi, ko buco busa bugyama ko sa bugyama. <verse eid="EPH 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 6:9" />Gahi amace yaba, gahi ma i ia̱ga gyama nahin nga Hwinsu uba hya, ita pagana ga iwasa, zwamu bu daki azi buna busa bulabe kamu nuhin buyiwa na zaro, pa buba kamu nuhi isa i bika.<verse eid="EPH 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hazunga ha gasa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 6:10" />Ni ihogu ka̱mu, yisana na kuce na soo Hwinsu Bugwama bu doone na kuce waba. <verse eid="EPH 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 6:11" />Mabwada hazunga ha gasa ha Hwinsu zwamu guwa bui pona yisana na gaba na Shetan na iri mahasa maba. <verse eid="EPH 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 6:12" />Sa na ikanga na mahya ga̠ci yiwa na ihona amma na sihuru si doone si wo, si zamani ana na aco cigwama, na aco koce, na cigwama ci zamani une u ci'incu. <verse eid="EPH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 6:13" />Zwama harbuniya, ma Bwada ka̱mu hazuga ha gasa ha Hwinsu! Zwam huna eewo iba i kure, bui pwana i yisana na koce si bu hogu ihona ini ka̱mu go yisan. <verse eid="EPH 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 6:14" />Zwamu harbuniya yisa na kuce na mazangi ma kamahinda kwa mapare, abe nabo, na cilapo ci gasa ci kamahinda, <verse eid="EPH 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 6:15" />Go na shiri kuro u gasa cikarigio ci numa dala burya̠ . <verse eid="EPH 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 6:16" />Ijidano ci yajo ci gasa, cina go bui pana gazgana mu ula mu buco bu eewo wata shaitan. <verse eid="EPH 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 6:17" />Zanga iporo i ruma, na iyajo na kasakari ka a̱huru a burya̠, wata cikarigo ci Hwinsu. <verse eid="EPH 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 6:18" />Ia̱g ahunda̱ na soo wa a̱huru a burya̠ tun nahon na makabo ina bu ma daka na soo nubuya, goo na ahunda daki hinda guwa na ye a hunda zamu alagano ka̠mu. <verse eid="EPH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 6:19" />Ni ia̱je ahunda, zwamu tuhumba hon ana gya na gunjiye uno namui, ina gya na gimbo kargyaga Hwinsu wui na pana Zwamu gya na cibaga asiri cikarigiwo ci Hwinsu, <verse eid="EPH 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 6:20" />Zwama gya nasa wakili u dalilin cikarigio ko dai nga gya na yiwa na ani pare ma na kasarka, na ia̱gi je a̱hunda nga̱ gya na za ihoge iwasa izwamu cikarigo ci Hwinsu.<verse eid="EPH 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ubungago wi Hogu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 6:21" />Tikikus, Buhun abuci buna gaci ka̠ri hinda bugwama Hwinsu, bui zwamma tuwamba ka̠mu, zwamu ga̠hi i daki ina gya nayiwa na ia̱ga. <verse eid="EPH 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 6:22" />Nai cumage Bware, zwamu ga̠hi daki nga̠ ci yiwa hinda bware bui karpapa <verse eid="EPH 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 6:23" />Ahun, dala a burya̠ na maka̠la̠ na yajo i Hwinsu buca na Buca̠ bu yaba Yesu Kristi. <verse eid="EPH 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 6:24" />Baniya burya̱ ka̱mu pa aco ana ka̱ri Bugwama bu duniya Yesu Kristi na maka̠la̠ mana maza a hare amin.<verse eid="EPH 6:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 6" />
</usx>